stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> idle
    idle --> opening: fresh authority and durable BEGIN intent
    opening --> active: target confirms transaction opened
    opening --> idle: target proves BEGIN refused without transaction
    opening --> outcome_unknown: BEGIN disposition unproven retire connection
    active --> commit_requested: desktop_owner COMMIT and fresh authority
    active --> active: COMMIT authority denied cleanup remains available
    active --> rollback_requested: desktop_owner rollback or expiry cleanup
    active --> outcome_unknown: engine loses write-bearing connection
    active --> failed_needs_rollback: target reports aborted transaction
    failed_needs_rollback --> rollback_requested: explicit rollback or expiry cleanup
    failed_needs_rollback --> failed_needs_rollback: refuse further SQL or COMMIT
    failed_needs_rollback --> outcome_unknown: rollback disposition lost
    rollback_requested --> rolled_back: target confirms rollback
    rollback_requested --> outcome_unknown: evidence lost
    commit_requested --> committed: target confirms commit
    commit_requested --> rolled_back: target proves transaction rolled back
    commit_requested --> outcome_unknown: reply lost or cancel unsettled
    active --> active: statement outcome recorded and transaction still active
    active --> committed: target proves implicit commit ended this transaction
    active --> outcome_unknown: implicit commit effects unproven
    committed --> [*]
    rolled_back --> [*]
    outcome_unknown --> outcome_unknown: operator acknowledges uncertainty
    outcome_unknown --> committed: decisive target commit evidence
    outcome_unknown --> rolled_back: decisive target rollback evidence
